      "eventPeriod": "2020年の構想",
      "informationDomain": "最初の需要と購入の実経緯",
      "attribution": "創業者本人の申告"
     },
     {
      "id": "df-012",
      "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
      "text": "開始時は無料100回、課金は月 USD 12。MRR 約 USD 600 で停滞し、価格を USD 15、18、24 へ変えたと回顧。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://datafetcher.com/blog/bootstrapping-saas-10k-mrr",
      "statedAt": "2022-09-12",
      "checkedAt": "2026-10-07",
      "eventPeriod": "2020〜2021年",
      "informationDomain": "商品と売り方",
      "attribution": "創業者本人の申告"
     },
     {
      "id": "df-013",
      "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
      "text": "Google Maps を取り込む動画は8視聴で1人、後に約1,000視聴で30人超の客を得たと本人が追跡。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://datafetcher.com/blog/bootstrapping-saas-10k-mrr",
      "statedAt": "2022-09-12",
      "checkedAt": "2026-10-07",
      "eventPeriod": "2021年の施策",
      "informationDomain": "その後の集客と購入・継続",
      "attribution": "創業者本人の申告"
     },
     {
      "id": "df-014",
      "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
      "text": "2021年末に専業へ移り、12月に用意済み接続を増やした改版を出した。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://datafetcher.com/blog/bootstrapping-saas-10k-mrr",
      "statedAt": "2022-09-12",
      "checkedAt": "2026-10-07",
      "eventPeriod": "2021年末",
      "informationDomain": "転機・失敗・外部条件・依存リスク",
      "attribution": "創業者本人の申告"
     },
     {
      "id": "df-015",
      "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
      "text": "有料利用分を謝礼にした操作試験で、客が実際に使う場面を観察した。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://datafetcher.com/blog/bootstrapping-saas-10k-mrr",
      "statedAt": "2022-09-12",
      "checkedAt": "2026-10-07",
      "eventPeriod": "改版前、正確な月未確認",
      "informationDomain": "日常運営",
      "attribution": "創業者本人の申告"
     },
     {
      "id": "df-016",
      "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
      "text": "月次解約約10%、売上ベースの純解約約5%と説明。自動実行の失敗を直し、単発利用や Airtable 離脱は残ると述べた。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://datafetcher.com/blog/bootstrapping-saas-10k-mrr",
      "statedAt": "2022-09-12",
      "checkedAt": "2026-10-07",
      "eventPeriod": "2022年の回顧時点",
      "informationDomain": "その後の集客と購入・継続",
      "attribution": "創業者本人の申告"
     },
     {
      "id": "df-017",
      "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
      "text": "Indeed で制作外注2人を採り、本人の制作週2〜3日を半日の確認へ変えたと記載。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://datafetcher.com/blog/bootstrapping-saas-10k-mrr",
      "statedAt": "2022-09-12",
      "checkedAt": "2026-10-07",
      "eventPeriod": "2022年の回顧時点",
      "informationDomain": "日常運営",
      "attribution": "創業者本人の申告"
     },
     {
      "id": "df-018",
      "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
      "text": "monday.com 向けを6週間試したが、更新の遅さと制限があり断念。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://datafetcher.com/blog/bootstrapping-saas-10k-mrr",
      "statedAt": "2022-09-12",
      "checkedAt": "2026-10-07",
      "eventPeriod": "正確な年月未確認、2022年9月以前",
      "informationDomain": "転機・失敗・外部条件・依存リスク",
      "attribution": "創業者本人の申告"
     },
     {
      "id": "df-019",
      "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
      "text": "Heroku と Redis 周りの障害対応や規模増への対応に数週間を使った。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://datafetcher.com/blog/bootstrapping-saas-10k-mrr",
      "statedAt": "2022-09-12",
      "checkedAt": "2026-10-07",
      "eventPeriod": "2022年",
      "informationDomain": "転機・失敗・外部条件・依存リスク",
      "attribution": "創業者本人の申告"
     },
     {
      "id": "df-020",
      "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
      "text": "対応用の管理画面と Calendly で客対応を週数時間以下にしたと記載。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://datafetcher.com/blog/bootstrapping-saas-10k-mrr",
      "statedAt": "2022-09-12",
      "checkedAt": "2026-10-07",
      "eventPeriod": "2022年の回顧時点",
      "informationDomain": "日常運営",
      "attribution": "創業者本人の申告"
     },
     {
      "id": "df-021",
      "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
      "text": "2022年の取材流入と大口の契約後、MRR が USD 10,000 に達したと記載。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://datafetcher.com/blog/bootstrapping-saas-10k-mrr",
