      "attribution": "取材記事に掲載された創業者の回答"
     },
     {
      "id": "df-028",
      "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
      "text": "React、TypeScript、GraphQL、Airtable SDK と、Node.js、PostgreSQL、Redis、Heroku を使うと回答。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.indiehackers.com/post/this-founder-built-8600-mrr-business-on-airtable-776c6c49d9",
