     },
     {
      "id": "df-029",
      "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
      "text": "自動実行は Airtable REST API、画面内の操作は SDK を使い、表の名前変更などへの対応が必要と説明。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.indiehackers.com/post/this-founder-built-8600-mrr-business-on-airtable-776c6c49d9",
